      "category": "ai",
      "title": "From the creator of Redis; run LLM locally with ds4",
      "url": "https://dwarfstar.sh/",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49936575",
      "score": 258,
      "comments": 68,
      "author": "fibo",
      "published": "2026-10-02T18:01:16Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Salvatore Sanfilippo (antirez) released ds4, a minimalist local LLM execution engine focused on pure C efficiency with zero bloat.",
        "Provides streamlined 4-bit model quantization and inference as a lightweight alternative to larger runtimes like llama.cpp or Ollama.",
        "Enables AI engineers to embed and inspect open-weights model inference directly without complex Python framework dependencies."
      ]
    },
